      "exact_quote": "Ref. Publications:\n     Airbus SB A350-92-P014 original issue dated 29 October 2018.\n\n     The use of later approved revisions of the above-mentioned document is acceptable for compliance\n     with the requirements of this AD.",
      "start_char": 1365,
      "end_char": 1591,
      "page_text_sha256": "e6b14fd4061c82d23da15ef8241ede7a38df9fe96e3ea5082582904b95bf74e9",
